	(text "MCU  -  ESP32-C3-WROOM-02"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.304 22.352 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "10a49552-98d9-4e9b-ae65-10bf91db51d1")
	)
	(text "Servo rail load switch (v7). A boost converter is not off when EN is low: VSYS -> L1 -> D4 still feeds SERVO_5V (servo idle + R22/R23).\nQ6 disconnects BOOST_IN from VSYS while BOOST_EN (IO10) is low. Q7 pulls the gate to ~VSYS-2.5 V via R28 when BOOST_EN is high.\nC22 (gate-drain) slews BOOST_IN at ~0.5 V/ms -> ~80 mA inrush into ~166 uF downstream. Firmware: BOOST_EN high >= 100 ms before a move."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.712 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "14122a99-3b32-474e-9f78-7bf8d0a20288")
	)
	(text "STEMMA QT port (v7): J5 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL.\nQ8 switches it from IO2 (low = on; R2 keeps it off at reset/sleep).\nQ9/Q10 isolate the bus when off, R29/R30 port pull-ups, U8 ESD.\nBME688 now at 0x76 (SDO = GND) - 0x77 free for add-ons.\nR31/R32: charger STAT (5 V) -> IO20 CHG_DET. Low = charging (with VBUS), high = done."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.414 244.094 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "15bdf859-cf70-4821-9c5c-f81c53da363c")
	)
	(text "Power  Path  +  3V3  LDO"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 188.214 106.172 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3e60f195-8728-45c8-8ba2-67e9c25016e5")
	)
	(text "Power switch: SW3 (0.1 A) only drives Q5's gate.\nPOS1 (1-2): gate = GND -> Q5 on\nPOS2 (2-3): gate = source -> Q5 off\nR26 10M holds Q5 off in the break-before-make gap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.574 176.784 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4aad301f-da3b-47cf-bbcc-7d8b0a22eda7")
	)
	(text ""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202.438 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "50641f6e-e217-4c8d-979f-b36f7a913e53")
	)
	(text "ESP32-C3 notes (MCU box):\nStrapping: IO2 (R2), IO8 (R5), IO9 (R3) pulled up 10k -> SPI boot.\nBOOT (SW2) low at reset -> USB download mode.\nIO8 drives the STATUS LED active-low (LED off = strap high).\nIO10 = BOOST_EN; R4 100k keeps the boost off at reset/sleep.\nEN: R1 10k + C1 1uF RC delay (Espressif HW design guide).\nUSB: IO18/IO19 native USB Serial/JTAG - no UART bridge.\n\nSW4 (OS103011MA7QP1, common = pin 2):\nPOS1 MODE_A (IO3) low = OFF | POS2 both high = SPARSE | POS3 MODE_B (IO4) low = CONTINUOUS.\n\nInternal pull-ups only. IO3/IO4 are deep-sleep wake-capable (GPIO0-5). VBAT_SENSE IO0 / VBUS_SENSE IO1 = ADC1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 270.002 96.266 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7960a2ac-b200-4102-ba2d-335452e79089")
	)
	(text "Air  Sensor  (BME688)"
